&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Categories (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; E-Commerce Solutions — Navigate &amp;amp; Categories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT DECATHLON &amp;amp; THE E-COMMERCE DOMAIN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon is accelerating its digital transformation with the mission of becoming &lt;strong&gt;the sports digital platform&lt;/strong&gt; that allows customers to discover our universe through local, sport-centered, and omnichannel experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining this scope, you will work within the &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Solutions&lt;/strong&gt; domain. Our teams build and transform the global e-commerce navigation, catalog treeviews, and backend categorization engines aiming to allows users to effortlessly discover and access Decathlon’s complete offering of products, services, and information&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOIN THE CATEGORIES SQUAD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the &lt;strong&gt;Group Product Manager (E-Commerce / Navigate)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will take ownership of the &lt;strong&gt;Categories&lt;/strong&gt; squad. You will work alongside a dedicated engineering squad (Tech Lead, Senior Software Engineers), and collaborate closely with UX Researchers, Product Designers, Data Analysts, Sports Digital Merchandisers, and local Country E-Commerce teams).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Empowering discovery through intelligent, scalable navigation. We build an intuitive, automated, and personalized browsing journey so every customer finds what they need, want, and desire faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive global conversion and incremental revenue by transforming fragmented local treeviews into a unified, high-performing Core Navigation across web and mobile platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product vision, strategy, and roadmap for the &lt;strong&gt;Categories &amp;amp; Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and arbitrate key product streams across &lt;strong&gt;Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; (standardizing category trees globally) and &lt;strong&gt;SKU-Level Categorization Engines&lt;/strong&gt; (such as our streaming engine &lt;em&gt;Tesseract&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align stakeholders across central sports teams, global digital merchandising, and local country teams around shared treeview operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously identify user, SEO, and market opportunities through data analysis, user testing, and card-sorting studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a continuous and consistent A/B testing process to refine business convictions and identify top growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance global standardization with local market flexibility, ensuring smooth migration from local catalog treeviews to global &lt;strong&gt;Core Trees&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear decision-making frameworks and SLAs for global taxonomy, SEO content guidance, and category creation governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead agile product delivery in close partnership with the Engineering Lead and squad members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize and mature the team’s backlog (epics, user stories) to support multi-level export feed pipelines, batch orchestration tooling, and taxonomy rules execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee key migration milestones for countries adopting the Core Navigation framework across desktop and mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track success metrics across navigation channels, including &lt;strong&gt;PDP Reach Rate, Revenue per Session, Menu Usage CTR&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Category-Level Conversion&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data analytics to streamline category performance, eliminating inactive categories and optimizing taxonomy filters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbitrate and prioritize backlog based on data driven decision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Mindset &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an ambassador for product excellence and taxonomy standards across Decathlon’s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative work environment based on trust, accountability, and user-centric decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFILE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience as a Product Manager in a fast-paced B2C e-commerce, digital platform, or catalog/search ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of e-commerce navigation, catalog treeviews, taxonomy/metadata structures, or search &amp;amp; discovery platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to navigate complex, multi-stakeholder international organizations (aligning global tech teams, business merchandisers, and country leads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery of end-to-end product development—from discovery (UX research, data analysis, A/B testing) to delivery (backlog refinement, technical roadmapping, release planning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Data-driven approach to prioritizing product features and measuring conversion and user experience impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English and French (written and spoken), with excellent synthesis skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; Curiosity for solving scalable architecture/data problems, user-centric design, and a strong passion for sports!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 days of remote work per week (flexible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based at our Decathlon Technology office in Paris, France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choice of Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work on your preferred device (Mac, Windows, Chromebook).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; High-impact role at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s global e-commerce engine, offering mentorship, certifications, and international growth paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Employee shareholding opportunities, along with monthly and quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Categories (h/f/x)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localisation :&lt;/strong&gt; Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domaine :&lt;/strong&gt; E-Commerce Solutions — Navigate &amp;amp; Categories&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À PROPOS DE DECATHLON &amp;amp; DU DOMAINE E-COMMERCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon accélère sa transformation digitale avec pour mission de devenir &lt;strong&gt;la plateforme digitale du sport&lt;/strong&gt; qui permet à nos clients de découvrir notre univers à travers des expériences locales, axées sur le sport et omnicanales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre Mission :&lt;/strong&gt; Faire bouger les gens à travers le sport pour rendre le bien-être accessible à tous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En rejoignant ce périmètre, vous travaillerez au sein du domaine &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;. Nos équipes transforment et déploient la navigation e-commerce mondiale, les arborescences de catalogue ainsi que les moteurs de catégorisation back-end visant à faciliter la découverte et l&#39;accès à la totalité de l&#39;offre Decathlon (produits, services et informations).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REJOIGNEZ LA SQUAD CATEGORIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché(e) au &lt;strong&gt;Group Product Manager (E-Commerce / Navigate)&lt;/strong&gt;, vous prendrez la responsabilité de la squad &lt;strong&gt;Categories&lt;/strong&gt;. Vous travaillerez aux côtés d&#39;une équipe d&#39;ingénierie dédiée (Tech Lead, Senior Software Engineers) et en étroite collaboration avec les UX Researchers, Product Designers, Data Analysts, Sports Digital Merchandisers ainsi que les équipes E-Commerce locales des différents pays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision Produit :&lt;/strong&gt; Favoriser la découverte grâce à une navigation intelligente et évolutive. Nous construisons un parcours de navigation intuitif, automatisé et personnalisé pour permettre à chaque client de trouver plus rapidement ce dont il a besoin et ce qu&#39;il désire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objectif Cible :&lt;/strong&gt; Stimuler la conversion globale et générer du chiffre d&#39;affaires incrémental en transformant des arborescences locales fragmentées en une &lt;strong&gt;Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; unifiée et performante sur le web et le mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VOS MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision &amp;amp; Stratégie Produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir la vision produit, la stratégie et la roadmap pour l&#39;écosystème &lt;strong&gt;Categories &amp;amp; Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter et arbitrer les chantiers clés du produit : &lt;strong&gt;Core Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; (standardisation des arborescences au niveau mondial) et les &lt;strong&gt;Moteurs de catégorisation au niveau SKU&lt;/strong&gt; (comme notre moteur de streaming &lt;em&gt;Tesseract&lt;/em&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligner les parties prenantes (équipes sports centrales, merchandising digital global, équipes pays) autour de modèles opérationnels partagés.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Gouvernance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier en continu les opportunités utilisateurs, SEO et business via l&#39;analyse de données, des tests utilisateurs et des études de card-sorting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Etablir un processus continue et consistant d&#39;AB test permettant d’affiner les convictions business et identifier les meilleurs opportunité de croissance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concilier la standardisation globale avec la flexibilité nécessaire aux marchés locaux, en assurant la migration fluide des arborescences locales vers les &lt;strong&gt;Core Trees&lt;/strong&gt; globaux.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Établir des cadres de décision et des SLA clairs pour la taxonomie globale, la gouvernance SEO et la création de catégories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Alignement Technique&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter le delivery agile en partenariat étroit avec le Tech Lead et les développeurs de la squad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioriser et affiner le backlog (epics, user stories) pour soutenir les flux d&#39;exportation multi-niveaux, les outils d&#39;orchestration de batchs et l&#39;exécution des règles taxonomiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superviser les jalons clés de migration pour les pays adoptant le framework Core Navigation sur desktop et mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir et suivre les métriques de succès de la navigation, notamment le &lt;strong&gt;PDP Reach Rate, le Revenu par Session, le CTR d&#39;utilisation du Menu&lt;/strong&gt; et la &lt;strong&gt;Conversion par Catégorie&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploiter l&#39;analyse de données pour optimiser la performance des catégories, éliminer les catégories inactives et rationaliser les filtres taxonomiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agencer et prioriser le backlog en s’appuyant sur de la data claire et fiable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Mindset Produit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incarner un rôle d&#39;ambassadeur de l&#39;excellence produit et des standards de taxonomie au sein du réseau international de Decathlon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Favoriser un environnement de travail collaboratif fondé sur la confiance, la responsabilité et la centricité utilisateur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL RECHERCHÉ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 à 5+ ans d&#39;expérience en tant que Product Manager dans un environnement B2C e-commerce, plateforme digitale ou écosystème catalogue/recherche.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Domaine :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellente compréhension de la navigation e-commerce, des arborescences de catalogue, des structures de taxonomie/données ou des plateformes de search &amp;amp; discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion des parties prenantes :&lt;/strong&gt; Capacité avérée à naviguer et aligner des organisations internationales complexes et multi-métiers (équipes tech, merchandisers, responsables e-commerce pays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Méthodologie Produit :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise du cycle de développement produit de bout en bout — de la discovery (UX research, data, A/B testing) au delivery (refinement du backlog, roadmap technique, déploiement).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit Analytique :&lt;/strong&gt; Approche orientée data pour prioriser les fonctionnalités et mesurer l&#39;impact sur la conversion et l&#39;expérience utilisateur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues &amp;amp; Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise courante de l&#39;anglais et du français (oral et écrit), avec d&#39;excellentes capacités de synthèse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion :&lt;/strong&gt; Curiosité pour la résolution de problèmes d&#39;architecture/données à grande échelle, la conception centrée utilisateur et une passion affirmée pour le sport !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Télétravail flexible :&lt;/strong&gt; 2 jours de télétravail par semaine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu de travail :&lt;/strong&gt; Basé dans nos locaux Decathlon Digital à Paris, France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Équipement au choix :&lt;/strong&gt; Travaillez sur votre équipement préféré (Mac, Windows, Chromebook).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Évolution :&lt;/strong&gt; Rôle à fort impact au cœur du moteur e-commerce global de Decathlon, offrant du mentorat, des certifications et des opportunités de carrière internationales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages Financiers :&lt;/strong&gt; Actionnariat salarié, primes mensuelles et trimestrielles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MAP | WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MAP is part of&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;5677231c-455b-4705-9250-42d6515234fb&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you have experience managing and implementing marketing automation projects with a hands-on and agile approach? Do you follow processes that keep you “on the ball” while also sharing your own opinion? Would you like to develop your skills working for well-known, successful international brands? Then you might be just the Technical Project Manager we’re looking for.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will your day look like?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the role as our new Technical Project Manager, you will be responsible for organizing and managing key client projects. Your job is to ensure a high level of quality, delivering projects on time and within budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More specifically, your tasks include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controlling the analysis phase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing project plans and requirements specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimating budgets and allocating internal resources and third parties/vendors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Securing that our configurators and developers is free of administrative overhead, securing that follow up, planning and time spend is overseen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing relationships with client and stakeholders, including motivating your colleagues in their day-to-day tasks.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who are you going to work with?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the linchpin in a network of closely coordinating Project Managers, Designers, User Experience Architects, Solution Architects and Developers. The position offers great opportunity for you to personally make a difference on the projects that you work on, and you can look forward to being supported every step of the way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What do you bring to the table?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are easy-going with a proactive, positive mind-set. You work to deliver the best possible outcome despite any challenges that arise, following processes that keep you “on the ball” while sharing your own opinion. As you will be managing several projects simultaneously, you are an organized person who can keep perspective while paying attention to details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience with either; Braze, Adobe Experience Platform or Salesforce marketing cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with managing and implementing projects within CRM, or marketing automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A conceptual, and a technical, understanding of data modelling, service-oriented and layered architectures, and complex technical solutions in general&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with agile methods of Scrum and/or Kanban&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication skills, enabling you to translate “business language” into technical language.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;A leader in personalized customer experiences&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MAP is a world-leading Centre of Excellence that helps businesses humanize the relationship between the brand and the customer through hyper personalization at scale, marketing automation and CRM. With the brain of a consultancy, the heart of an agency and the power of technology and data, we work with some of the world&#39;s most admired brands to help them on their transformation journey to becoming truly customer-centric. Together, we are 1000 + technology specialists, data scientists, strategic thinkers, consultants, operations experts, and creative minds from 55+ nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (MAP/VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click “Apply now” below, your information is sent to MAP/VML. To learn more about how we process your personal data during when you apply for a role with us, on how you can update your information or have the information removed please read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wt-map.com/privacy-policy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;1be1ea03-7c74-4825-b023-8bda1dc2d911&quot;&gt;Privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wundermanthompson.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;02863cf9-cae6-4a11-b7f1-4f68ba8e0816&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BVNK is the stablecoin-powered financial stack for enterprises. We&#39;re now part of Mastercard, and together we&#39;re building a network for every form of money – one that delivers more reach, more capability and more choice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We enable businesses to build financial products, unlock new markets, and move money in seconds across 130+ countries, with 40+ licenses for fiat and digital assets globally. Processing billions annually, we empower enterprises worldwide to send, receive, convert, and settle stablecoins and fiat seamlessly through a single integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our mission is to accelerate global money movement, and we&#39;re assembling a world-class team to make it happen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trusted by industry leaders like Corpay, Worldpay, Deel, and Flywire, we deliver the infrastructure that makes new forms of money usable within the financial systems customers already rely on today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining Mastercard&#39;s global payment reach and trusted networks with BVNK&#39;s stablecoin infrastructure, we&#39;re building the trusted operating layer for the evolution of money movement, helping customers participate in emerging digital networks without having to rebuild their businesses around every new innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a diverse team spread across EMEA, North America, and APAC, with a shared belief that stablecoins are the new infrastructure layer for financial services, and that BVNK is at the forefront of this shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re incredibly honored to have been recognized by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC World&#39;s Top Fintech Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FXC Intelligence Top 100 Cross-border Payment Companies (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s The Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces (three years running, most recently 2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn as one of the Top 20 Startups in the UK (2025)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role in the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Product Manager to own the product vision, strategy, and delivery for the Reporting &amp;amp; Customer Reconciliation subdomain within BVNK&#39;s Ledger domain. You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp; work closely with engineering, design, finance, operations, and commercial teams to define how BVNK&#39;s customers&amp;nbsp; and BVNK&#39;s own internal teams — see, understand, and trust their financial data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ledger domain is the financial backbone of BVNK, a single, trusted source of truth for all customer and transactional balances across products, currencies, and rails. Within this domain, the Reporting &amp;amp; Customer Reconciliation subdomain is responsible for providing clear, consistent financial views derived from the ledger for both internal and external reporting. Through the Reporting Service, Search Service, and downstream data surfaces,it ensures that positions, balances, and movements are accurately represented for Finance, Risk, Operations, and customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, cross-functional role. As part of BVNK&#39;s Billing 2.0 vision and the drive toward a 100% self-serve customer experience, you&#39;ll define and deliver the product capabilities that give customers full transparency; enabling them to reconcile invoices, audit charges programmatically, and automate close processes, while also building the internal reporting foundations that Finance, Reconciliation, and Operations depend on to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Areas of Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the product vision and roadmap for Reporting &amp;amp; Customer Reconciliation&lt;/strong&gt; — Define the strategy for how BVNK exposes financial data to customers and internal teams, aligning with the broader Ledger domain mission and company objectives (Billing 2.0, self-serve experience, MiCA compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive transaction report fee breakdowns&lt;/strong&gt; — Define requirements and work with engineering to ensure transaction reports and APIs properly include both real-time and invoiced fees, broken down by fee type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the customer reconciliation product &lt;/strong&gt;— Define and deliver customer-facing reconciliation endpoints and reporting surfaces that enable enterprise clients to programmatically audit charges, automate close processes, and reconcile against invoices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve internal financial reporting&lt;/strong&gt; — Partner with Finance, Reconciliation, and Operations to understand their data needs and deliver standardised reports and views that replace fragmented, manual processes with reliable, automated data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across domains &lt;/strong&gt;— Work with the Billing &amp;amp; Fees, Wallets, Balances , Digital Assets, Treasury, and Reconciliation domain to ensure reporting data is consistent and accurate end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define reporting for multi-entity and regulatory requirements&lt;/strong&gt; — As BVNK expands across jurisdictions and customer types, ensure reporting structures correctly represent entity-specific data, segregation requirements, and regulatory obligations (MiCA safekeeping, EMI reconciliation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own stakeholder relationships &lt;/strong&gt;— Serve as the primary product contact for Reporting &amp;amp; Customer Reconciliation. Engage regularly with Commercial (AMs/CSMs), Finance, Operations, and enterprise customers to gather requirements, validate solutions, and communicate roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and iterate&lt;/strong&gt; — Define and track KPIs for reporting accuracy, customer adoption of reconciliation tools, reduction in manual reconciliation effort, and internal stakeholder satisfaction. Use data to inform roadmap prioritisation and demonstrate impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship with quality&lt;/strong&gt; — Write clear PRDs, user stories, and acceptance criteria. Participate in architecture reviews and technical design submissions. Run beta programmes with select customers and internal teams to validate reporting capabilities before general availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need from you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of product management experience in fintech, payments, or financial services — ideally with exposure to ledger systems, financial reporting, or reconciliation products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of financial data and reporting — you&#39;ve worked with transaction data, balance reporting, reconciliation workflows, or invoicing systems. You understand concepts like double-entry bookkeeping, ledger postings, balance snapshots, and fee structures or can learn them quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal and customer-facing data products — you&#39;ve defined and delivered reporting APIs, dashboards, data exports, or reconciliation tools that serve both external customers and internal operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills — you&#39;re comfortable working with engineering, finance, operations, compliance, and commercial teams. You can translate complex financial requirements into clear product specifications and negotiate priorities across stakeholders with competing needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven decision making — you use quantitative and qualitative data to inform roadmap decisions, measure product impact, and communicate outcomes to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency — you don&#39;t need to write code, but you can engage meaningfully with engineers on API design, data models, event-driven architectures, and database schemas. You&#39;re comfortable with tools like Snowflake, QuickSight, or similar BI/data warehousing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a fast-paced, scaling environment — you&#39;ve operated in a startup or scale-up where scope is broad, resources are constrained, and you need to make pragmatic trade-offs between ideal and achievable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication — you write clear PRDs, run effective stakeholder meetings, and can present product strategy to senior leadership with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-first mindset — you&#39;re effectively working across time zones in an asynchronous-first culture, using Slack, Confluence, and Jira as primary collaboration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with regulated financial services (EMI, VASP) and compliance reporting requirements (MiCA, safeguarding, client money rules).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in B2B payments platforms, stablecoin infrastructure, or crypto-adjacent products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with reconciliation platforms (Duco, Xero, or similar) and financial ledger systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with multi-tenant architectures and entity-level data segregation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of event-driven data pipelines (Kafka, outbox patterns) and how they impact data consistency in reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product experience with self-serve billing or invoicing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can expect from us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fair and &lt;strong&gt;competitive salary&lt;/strong&gt; at every stage of your growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working&lt;/strong&gt; hours, with hybrid working at its heart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;culture&lt;/strong&gt; built on passionate, growth-minded people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;flexible approach to holiday&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to travel to our &lt;strong&gt;offices around the world&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;open and creative environment&lt;/strong&gt; where you can help us define the future of BVNK, its culture, and its opportunity sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At BVNK, we are focused on building a diverse and inclusive team. While you may not meet all of our requirements, we’d encourage you to apply if you meet the majority of our expectations. You may be a great fit for this role or another role in our team. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Bulgaria Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€90.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€90.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Malta Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€90.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation packages are based on candidate experience and relevant certifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Poland Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€90.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At the heart of our robotic platforms are robust sensor networks and reliable operating systems. As a Robotics Product Owner, you will be the vital link between high-level system requirements and daily engineering execution.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will guide a cross-functional team of hardware and software engineers through a rapidly growing portfolio of projects. By taking inputs from system engineers and program managers, you will ensure the team always has clear, actionable, and prioritized work, while keeping the broader organization informed of our technical capabilities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Translate Needs:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work closely with system engineers and program managers to break down complex system requirements into clear, actionable user stories and acceptance criteria for the engineering team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Push the Backlog:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Regularly align with the team lead to manage and prioritize the team&#39;s backlog across the hardware and software stack, balancing long-term foundational architecture with immediate project milestones.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Drive Execution:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Facilitate daily alignment across the team—from hardware engineers working on optics and supplier specs, to software engineers building out embedded systems and sensor overlays—to unblock work and keep sprints moving smoothly.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Document Capabilities:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Maintain clear, accessible, and up-to-date documentation of our technical capabilities, system resources, and sprint outcomes so stakeholders always know what the team can deliver.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Evaluate &amp;amp; Accept Work:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Review completed engineering work against requirements, navigating collaborative trade-offs when friction arises between hardware constraints, embedded software performance, and project timelines.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;3+ years of experience as a Technical Product Manager, or similar roles, specifically working on hardware-software integrated products, robotics, IoT, or complex technical platforms.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Technical Literacy:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;You are comfortable reviewing technical structures, navigating code repositories on GitLab, and collaborating effectively with software engineers.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Systems Thinking:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;A solid understanding of the robotics and embedded tech stack. You should feel comfortable discussing sensor calibration, edge computing (like Jetson platforms), driver integration, and overall system architecture.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exceptional ability to communicate complex concepts clearly, acting as the bridge between deeply technical engineers and higher-level program managers.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Familiarity with sensor hardware lifecycles and optics.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience with embedded Linux, Jetson carrier boards, or base image configuration.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience with Agile frameworks in a hardware context.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Previous experience working in the defense, aerospace, or autonomous vehicle sectors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fluent English (C1 preferred). German language skills are advantageous but not required.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark Defence, we are committed to building a diverse, inclusive, and high-performing team. We operate in an industry where women, as well as other minority groups, are systematically under-represented. We actively encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds and identities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are excited about this role, we encourage you to apply even if you don&#39;t meet all the listed qualifications—ability and impact cannot be summarised in a few bullet points. We value unique perspectives, adaptability, and a drive to solve high-stakes challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Security Clearance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe Digital Repair recherche un·e &lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; (f/m/d) en CDI basé·e à Lille (Campus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L&#39;équipe Digital Repair a pour mission de prolonger la durée de vie de nos produits sportifs grâce à des solutions numériques innovantes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Composée de profils variés et passionnés (développeurs, product managers, designers), notre équipe relève le défi de l&#39;économie circulaire chez Decathlon.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;En nous rejoignant, tu auras un impact direct sur la réduction de notre empreinte écologique tout en offrant une expérience de réparation fluide, fiable et accessible à nos utilisateurs à travers le monde.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;En tant que Quality Engineer (f/m/d), tu seras le/la garant·e de la qualité des produits que nous mettons à disposition de nos utilisateurs. Tes missions principales seront :&lt;br&gt;* Accompagner les équipes de développement dans la mise en place et le maintien de l&#39;automatisation des tests.&lt;br&gt;* Proposer et ajouter de nouvelles méthodes de test pour toujours garantir un plus haut niveau de qualité tout en réduisant les temps de delivery.&lt;br&gt;* Diffuser la culture de la qualité au sein de l&#39;équipe et collaborer étroitement avec les développeurs dès la phase de conception.&lt;br&gt;* Suivre les indicateurs de qualité et assurer la fiabilité globale de nos parcours utilisateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Tu as une expérience solide et confirmée en test d&#39;applications Web et de micro-services.&lt;br&gt;* Tu maîtrises l&#39;usage de l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle (IA) appliquée au métier de la QA pour optimiser et innover dans tes méthodes de test.&lt;br&gt;* Tu es reconnu·e pour ton esprit de synthèse, ta rigueur et ta capacité à évangéliser les bonnes pratiques de qualité.&lt;br&gt;* Tu sais t&#39;intégrer et collaborer efficacement dans un environnement agile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STACK TECHNIQUE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;* Automatisation et tests : Playwright, JEST, Karate&lt;br&gt;* Suivi et gestion : JIRA&lt;br&gt;* Intégration continue (CI) : GitHub Actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;br&gt;* Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;br&gt;* Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;br&gt;* Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;br&gt;* Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
