&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Enablement builds Raisin&#39;s internal AI platform. We make it easy and safe for every team, from engineering and product to business operations, to use AI in their daily work and in the products they build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We provide the shared foundation for that: governed access to AI models and tools, the controls that keep data secure and usage auditable, and the visibility teams need to run AI reliably and cost-effectively. We also shape how Raisin builds software with AI, from AI-assisted coding to agentic workflows that support teams across the development lifecycle. Because Raisin operates in regulated financial services, security and compliance are core to how we design the platform.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will join early and help shape how AI is used across Raisin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an AI Platform Engineer, you build and run the platform that lets teams use AI safely, and you help engineering teams bring AI into how they build software. You own your work from the first design to production and work directly with the people who use it. You won&#39;t do all of the following at once: you will go deep in a few areas and contribute to the rest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run the platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate shared services that give teams governed access to AI models and tools, including authentication, routing across providers, usage limits, guardrails, and audit logging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build safe ways for AI agents to connect to internal systems and data, with clear identity, permissions, and review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run what you build in production: infrastructure as code, observability for reliability, usage, and cost, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring AI into how we build software&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build agentic workflows that support engineers across the development lifecycle, from planning and implementation to code review, testing, and release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable building blocks for AI tools, such as agent instructions, skills, and integrations with engineering systems, that teams can adopt and extend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help engineering teams adopt AI-assisted development in a way that improves quality as well as speed, and measure the effect on delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Treat the platform as a product for internal customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineers, product managers, and business teams to understand their needs and turn them into platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the platform and its tools easy to adopt through self-service, sensible defaults, and clear documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure adoption, reliability, cost, and impact, and use that data to decide what to build next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own technical decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design of new capabilities from first idea to production, including build-versus-buy choices, and document decisions so others can follow the reasoning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with security, legal, and compliance colleagues to turn their requirements into controls the platform enforces automatically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make principled model choices based on cost, latency, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar for the engineers around you through design reviews, pairing, and sharing what you learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years as a software engineer in backend, platform, or infrastructure roles, including production systems that other teams depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building for internal customers: a platform, developer tooling, or shared services used by other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in at least one programming language (Python preferred; TypeScript and JVM languages also relevant).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid cloud and delivery fundamentals: AWS or another major cloud, containers, infrastructure as code, and CI/CD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with LLM APIs or AI tooling beyond experiments, and you use AI coding assistants in your daily work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable with evolving scope, make pragmatic trade-offs, and explain them clearly to technical and non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LLM gateways, the Model Context Protocol (MCP), managed model services, or agent runtimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have rolled out AI-assisted development workflows for other engineers, such as agent instructions, reusable skills, or automated code review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity and access: OAuth 2.0 / OIDC, SSO, role-based access control, or delegated access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API gateways, rate limiting, multi-tenant isolation, or observability (OpenTelemetry or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A feel for the cost, latency, and quality trade-offs of different models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to tick every box. If you have strong platform or developer-tooling experience and real curiosity about AI, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt; About the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal supports Alma to grow safely and sustainably by anticipating and managing legal risk, providing pragmatic advice, negotiating contracts, and supporting teams across the company; in a strongly regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Legal&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;reports to Alma’s General Secretary and lead the Legal function. You will be a trusted partner to the Director’s Committee and work closely with Product, Tech, Sales, Operations, Finance, Risk, Compliance, Information Security and People.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer, with the independence, resources and direct access to senior management required to perform the role effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent position based in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Legal, you will define Alma’s legal and privacy strategy and ensure that it supports the company’s business ambitions, regulatory obligations and risk appetite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and lead Alma’s legal strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a clear legal roadmap aligned with Alma’s business and international strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, assess and manage Alma’s main legal risks, escalating material matters to executive management and governance bodies when appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, pragmatic and business-oriented advice to the Executive Committee and teams across Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex legal requirements into actionable recommendations, policies and scalable operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor relevant legal developments across Alma’s markets and anticipate their impact on the company’s products and activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Alma’s business, products and partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product and Tech teams throughout the design and launch of new products and features, embedding legal and privacy considerations from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Sales, Account Management, Operations and other business teams on strategic projects and complex legal questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the drafting, review and negotiation of commercial agreements, including agreements with merchants, partners, suppliers and technology providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable contracting standards, templates, playbooks and approval processes that enable teams to move quickly while controlling legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on strategic transactions, partnerships, outsourcing arrangements and international expansion projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee corporate and governance matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Alma’s corporate legal matters and ensure that its legal entities comply with applicable governance and corporate requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive management and governance bodies in preparing decisions and maintaining appropriate corporate documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on financing, corporate transactions, intellectual property, competition law and other strategic legal matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external counsel and manage the legal budget, ensuring that external expertise is used effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee litigation, pre-litigation, claims and other disputes, defining the appropriate strategy and protecting Alma’s interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as Alma’s Data Protection Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and oversee Alma’s data protection framework in accordance with the GDPR and other applicable privacy laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform and advise Alma and its employees on their data protection obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor compliance through appropriate policies, processes, controls and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and continuously improve Alma’s privacy governance, including records of processing activities, privacy notices, retention standards and procedures for handling data-subject requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a robust framework for data protection impact assessments and ensure that DPIAs are conducted when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product, Tech, Data, Risk, Operations, Marketing and People teams on privacy-by-design and privacy-by-default principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Information Security on personal-data breaches, incident response, security measures and regulatory notifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as Alma’s primary contact for data protection authorities and cooperate with them when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop training and awareness initiatives to foster a strong data protection culture throughout Alma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the Legal team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear vision, priorities and operating model for the Legal team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, coach and develop team members, promoting high standards of expertise, ownership and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocate resources according to business priorities and ensure that legal requests are handled effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define meaningful objectives and indicators to measure the team’s impact, service quality and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships across Alma and position Legal as both a strategic partner and an independent control function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine excellent legal judgment with a strong understanding of business. You are comfortable taking clear positions on complex matters while remaining pragmatic and solution-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are likely to thrive in this role if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can move comfortably between strategic questions and hands-on legal work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how to balance business velocity, customer experience, innovation and legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate complex legal matters clearly to both legal and non-legal audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior leaders and challenge decisions constructively when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy developing people and creating clarity for a multidisciplinary team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable working with incomplete information and taking ownership of sensitive or high-impact decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong negotiation, drafting and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in both French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a Master’s degree in law or an equivalent legal qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience in senior legal positions (15+ years), combining experience in a leading bank or FinTech and a law firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong expertise in banking, commercial and technology contracts, corporate matters and business law.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international activities and working across several European jurisdictions would also be valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the level of expertise and professional standing required to act as Data Protection Officer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Hiring process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because of the strategic importance of this role, the recruitment process will be thorough while remaining as efficient as possible. It is expected to include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An introductory conversation with the Talent Acquisition team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with the General Secretary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical case study focused on legal strategy, business partnering and data protection with key members of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetings with key members of Alma’s leadership and relevant cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interview with one of our co-founders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Apaleo is the world’s most open, API-first property management platform powering the next generation of hospitality operations. Its modular, AI-powered infrastructure enables hoteliers to customise their tech stack, automate routine work, and deliver seamless, personalised guest experiences, powered by best-in-class apps and autonomous AI agents that adapt to every stay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why this role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the technical voice in front of strategic customers, at a moment when hospitality is being rebuilt around AI. We are launching our own AI agent platform, and we need architects who can show operators what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High trust.&lt;/strong&gt; You own the technical answer in front of strategic customers and deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High visibility.&lt;/strong&gt; Your work shows up in deals, key accounts and customer stories, and it reaches Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High freedom.&lt;/strong&gt; You decide how to solve a problem, which tools to use and what to prototype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast iteration.&lt;/strong&gt; We test ideas within days, try new technology early and share what works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Win and grow strategic accounts with technical credibility, and turn what you learn in the field into input for the product. You look at a customer&#39;s current architecture and show how an Apaleo-centred setup delivers their goals. You also help them put AI agents to work, deciding what should be an agent, what it costs and how to set it up. Sales and Account Management own the relationship and the commercial terms. You own the technical answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical discovery and solution scoping.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery where a standard demo is not enough. Write clear scopes covering what Apaleo delivers natively, what needs a short-term solution and what is out of scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proofs of concept.&lt;/strong&gt; Build fast, working proofs of concept (quick demos that show technical fit). Agree scope in writing first, and build in a safe test environment, never with live guest data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agents and automations.&lt;/strong&gt; Design and build agents and automations for customer use cases, using n8n or Make today and Apaleo&#39;s own AI agent platform as it launches. Write code where agents need deterministic steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on delivery and short-term solutions.&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside the customer, building only where it unblocks a named deal, removes an adoption risk or fills a product gap. Agree an exit plan (an end date, a replacement and a named owner) before you start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-sale health checks and expansions.&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose gaps against the go-live specification, run proactive checks (for example 90 days after go-live) and scope integrations for expanding customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reusable assets.&lt;/strong&gt; Turn every engagement into a reference architecture, pattern or template that the next twenty customers can use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; Join prospect and customer conversations on how AI will change hospitality over the next two to three years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product feedback.&lt;/strong&gt; Test new technology on real customer problems. Share prototypes and field evidence with Product, ending every experiment with a clear decision: adopt, hand over or drop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How you work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You decide the approach, the stack and the order of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You protect three guardrails: written scope before a proof of concept, an exit plan before a custom build and no commercial promises.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You go from idea to prototype in days and show it early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think in systems and build for reuse, not one-off projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You share findings openly with Sales, Account Management and Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales/BD and Account Management (they call you in at defined deal triggers), Customer Success, Product, Security, Partnerships, RevOps and Senior Leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple years in solution architecture, solution engineering or technical consulting in B2B SaaS, ideally with complex software such as ERP or enterprise platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong API skills: REST, authentication, webhooks and events, and data-flow design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on workflow automation (n8n preferred) and practical experience building with LLM agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker with real AI curiosity, who uses AI tools day to day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder management experience and credibility with executives and IT teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-direction, an ownership mindset and the discipline to say no to scope that does not advance a deal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity that ends in working prototypes, not just opinions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, structured documentation habits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and French skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel, including regularly to France and the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hospitality or travel experience, including hotel operations and PMS concepts (reservations, folios, rate plans, night audit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with another cloud PMS, channel manager or payments integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise architecture experience on large, multi-site projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applied AI or ML background, or experience with MCP and agent platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL and BI fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How we measure success&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture engagements and blueprints delivered each quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer satisfaction with your contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption of recommended apps, integrations and agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share of engagements served by an existing reusable pattern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue impact e.g. deal unblocked, AI adoption, or churn averted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your first 90 days&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Days 1 to 30:&lt;/strong&gt; Learn the platform and ways of working, shadow discovery and proof of concept work, and take over open customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Days 31 to 60:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical discovery on live deals and run your first health check with Account Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Days 61 to 90:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver a proof of concept or short-term solution end to end with an exit plan, and share your first experiment with Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Diverse &amp;amp; International Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work alongside passionate professionals from over 20 nationalities, bringing unique cultural perspectives, backgrounds, and experiences to shape the future of hospitality tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;As we scale, so do your opportunities. You’ll benefit from 360° feedback reviews, a dedicated learning budget, and plenty of chances to take on more responsibility. Our evolving career framework ensures you have increasing opportunities to learn new skills, advance your career, and make an impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Great ideas can come from anywhere. We empower you to take responsibility, make decisions, and contribute directly in an environment built on trust, transparency, and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Future of Hospitality Tech:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Be part of a fast-growing scale-up transforming the hospitality industry. From day one, your work drives real impact and you’ll have the freedom to bring your ideas to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive &amp;amp; Fair Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe great work deserves great pay. Our salaries are competitive and guided by benchmarking data to ensure fairness across all roles and teams. We make sure to recognize and reward performance and contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible &amp;amp; Remote Work Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We focus on results, not clocking hours. You can work from home, the office or in a hybrid setup, with flexibility to adapt your schedule as long as it makes sense for your role, your team and our business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Connection:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong connections fuel collaboration. We celebrate and connect through regular team dinners, company meetups, Oktoberfest celebrations, Christmas parties, and other offsite events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Enjoy&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to fully disconnect, recharge, and return inspired.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prioritize your health with access to hundreds of gyms, fitness studios, and wellness options through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;EGYM Wellpass&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;membership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you make an impact joining Apaleo:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Joining Apaleo means more than just taking on a role it’s about driving real change in the hospitality industry. Your contributions will directly shape our innovative platform, influence company-wide decisions, and help redefine the future of hospitality tech. At Apaleo, your voice matters, your ideas are valued, and your impact is tangible. Be part of a team where your work fuels progress, collaboration sparks innovation, and growth is a shared journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer, committed to fostering a diverse, inclusive, and welcoming workplace. We encourage applications from individuals of all backgrounds, regardless of race, color, religion, gender identity or expression, sex, national origin, age, marital status, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. Your personal data will be handled with the utmost care and in compliance with GDPR and relevant data protection regulations. We celebrate differences and believe that diversity enriches our team and drives innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
