&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Our Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a dynamic and customer-focused &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Commercial team in Zurich. This role is ideal for a professional who enjoys combining business insight with technical expertise to help clients solve complex challenges. As a key partner to our Sales, Product, and Operations teams, you will play a critical role in designing tailored solutions, accelerating sales cycles, and ensuring successful customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct discovery sessions with prospective clients to understand business processes, challenges, and technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex client needs into effective solution designs and technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and present tailored solutions leveraging our product capabilities and integration options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling product demonstrations, presentations, and proof-of-concept workshops for clients and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the sales team as a technical and functional expert throughout the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and contribute to RFI and RFP responses, ensuring accuracy and alignment with customer expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide effort estimations and implementation guidance for proposed solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product Development, Operations, and Implementation teams to ensure solution feasibility and successful delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather customer feedback and market insights to support product innovation and strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop sales enablement materials, technical documentation, and case studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Logistics/Supply Chain Management, Computer Science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Solutions Consultant, Business Implementations, Presales Engineer, Solution Architect, or a similar customer-facing role within enterprise software, SaaS based environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply chain management, logistics, or related industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CRM platforms and project management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with integration technologies such as APIs and ETL processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent written and spoken English, other language skills are beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role will be measured through:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality and customer-focused solution designs and proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective support of the sales process resulting in accelerated deal closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer satisfaction with demonstrations, presentations, and proposed solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accuracy and completeness of RFI/RFP responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful collaboration across Commercial, Product, Implementation, and Operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous contribution to product improvement through market and client insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased conversion of qualified opportunities into successful customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with innovative technology solutions in a dynamic commodity trading environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to international clients and complex business challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and entrepreneurial company culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact on business growth and customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close interaction with senior stakeholders and industry experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and career growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exciting role at the intersection of technology, consulting, and commercial strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you are passionate about solving business challenges, working with clients, and delivering innovative solutions that create real value, we&#39;d love to hear from you. Apply today and join our team as a Solutions Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Castrol is one of the world’s leading lubricant brands, serving customers and consumers in the automotive, marine, industrial and energy sectors. Castrol brands are recognised globally for their premium quality and high performance, shaped by the company’s commitment to innovation and cutting-edge technology. With products sold in more than 150 countries, Castrol has helped keep things moving on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt; roads &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;and racetracks, air, sea, and space for over 125 years.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Whether you&#39;re just starting out or ready for your next big move, you&#39;re in the right place to explore an exciting career with Castrol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the team&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join Castrol&#39;s Global Pricing team, reporting to the Global Strategic Pricing Manager and leading a small team of data scientists and analysts. Working alongside colleagues with pricing and commercial expertise, you&#39;ll combine technical problem-solving with developing others, turning your team&#39;s analysis into decisions that improve revenue, margin and product mix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which pricing questions are worth solving, and how do you turn the answers into something the business can use? You&#39;ll help connect the commercial problem, the analytical approach and the practical solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find where margin is being lost across discounts, rebates and trade investments. Quantify the opportunity, recommend corrective action and support governance of pricing corridors, floors and exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the business make better product-price-pack and portfolio choices across DIY, DIFM and B2B channels. Explore customers, segments, specifications, pack sizes and tiers to inform price positioning and the price steps between offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deploy models for elasticity, demand forecasting, willingness to pay, price sensitivity, scenarios and price optimisation, translating the results into recommendations people can act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn recurring work into repeatable tools. Design automation for price changes, analysis, reporting and decision support, reducing manual intervention and making solutions usable across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop your analytical team, encouraging commercial curiosity and innovation. Set priorities around business value, plan projects and help colleagues turn their technical work into practical outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Pricing, Sales, Finance and Marketing, using clear explanations of the evidence to influence senior stakeholders and connect analytical findings to commercial decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success means more than delivering a model: it means measurable commercial impact, pricing processes that need less manual effort, and a team that understands its priorities and develops its capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience required&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need a long management career behind you. You&#39;ll need technical depth, evidence that your analysis makes a difference, and the aptitude to help others do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A university degree or higher, with proven experience in pricing analytics, data science or operations research, ideally in a commercial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mathematical and statistical modelling skills, including regression, machine learning and segmentation, and the ability to apply them to questions such as demand forecasting, elasticity and price optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in analytical tools such as Python, R and SQL and visualisation platforms such as Power BI or Tableau, with experience working with large datasets and building scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of translating analysis into business impact, supported by commercial judgement, problem-solving and decision-making skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability and aptitude to lead and develop a small analytical team. Previous leadership or mentoring experience is valuable, but strong technical candidates with less management experience will also be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering and leading projects, with the initiative, planning, prioritisation and collaborative approach needed to keep work moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent written and spoken English, with the ability to explain complex findings, influence stakeholders at different levels and build relationships within and beyond Global Pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desirable: pricing or revenue growth management experience, including gross-to-net, trade spend and portfolio/mix optimisation. Strong transferable data science or operations research experience is welcome, with scope to learn the pricing domain; exposure to automation tools and workflows is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;The Castrol entity recruiting for this role is the data controller for the personal information you provide. We use it to assess your application and to manage the recruitment and onboarding process. We may share it with service providers who support our recruitment, and it may be transferred to other Castrol entities internationally under appropriate safeguards. We keep it only for as long as necessary. For details of how we use your information and your data protection rights, contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;OWAcac3778b-aec2-4e71-7765-87f7daa1b8b6&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, socioeconomic status, neurodiversity/neurocognitive functioning, veteran status or disability status. Individuals with an accessibility need may request an adjustment/accommodation related to Castrol recruiting process (e.g., accessing the job application, completing required assessments, participating in telephone screenings or interviews, etc.).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are selected for a position and depending upon your role, your employment may be contingent upon adherence to local policy. This may include pre-placement drug screening, medical review of physical fitness for the role, and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STARK &lt;/strong&gt;is a new kind of defence technology company revolutionizing the way autonomous systems are deployed across multiple domains. We design, develop and manufacture high performance unmanned systems that are software-defined, mass-scalable, and cost effective. This provides our operators with a decisive edge in highly contested environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re focused on delivering deployable, high-performance systems - not future promises. In a time of rising threats, STARK is bolstering the technological edge of NATO Allies and their Partners to deter aggression and defend Europe - today.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;You will be reporting to the VP Media Relations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and skilled &lt;strong&gt;Senior Media and Communications Officer&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(All Genders)&lt;/strong&gt; to support our growing communications team. Based in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;or&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Munich&lt;/strong&gt;, the successful candidate will play a key role in building the company’s reputation across Germany and internationally, with a particular focus on media relations, content development, and strategic messaging.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Develop and implement media strategies that support the company’s objectives&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proactively pitch stories and manage relationships with German and international media outlets&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Draft press releases, op-eds, briefings, Q&amp;amp;As, and reactive statements in both English and German&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Monitor media coverage and provide regular analysis and insight to internal stakeholders&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support the delivery of major announcements, media events, and leadership engagements&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure message consistency across all external communications, including alignment with corporate narrative&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work with other internal teams to develop content that showcases the company’s technology, partnerships, and impact&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Act as a key point of contact for media enquiries&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Minimum of 3+ years’ experience in communications, journalism, or media relations, preferably within the defence or security sectors&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong understanding of the media landscape in Germany and Europe, with a proven track record of securing coverage&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in both German and English (native-level fluency in at least one)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience managing sensitive and high-stakes media moments, including crisis communications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Confident working with senior executives and external stakeholders&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Able to translate complex technical topics into clear, compelling messaging&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Highly organised, proactive, and able to manage multiple priorities under pressure&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY&amp;nbsp;CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal-pportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Send&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;CV&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;English&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;apply.&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;touch&amp;nbsp;shortly.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark Defence, we are committed to building a diverse, inclusive, and high-performing team. We operate in an industry where women, as well as other minority groups, are systematically under-represented. We actively encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds and identities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are excited about this role, we encourage you to apply even if you don&#39;t meet all the listed qualifications—ability and impact cannot be summarised in a few bullet points. We value unique perspectives, adaptability, and a drive to solve high-stakes challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Security Clearance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 class=&quot;sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 ghXWGq custom-css-style-job-description&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Reporting Line:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW53634494 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Paragraph SCXW53634494 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At constellr, we use thermal intelligence from space to understand what is happening on Earth - where, when and at scale. Our satellite constellation delivers high-resolution land surface temperature data, giving governments, defence organisations, commercial operators and global institutions the intelligence they need to monitor change, assess risk and make better-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From national security and critical infrastructure to agriculture and climate resilience, constellr turns temperature into actionable intelligence for a changing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As our Senior Business Development Manager for the Public Sector, you will join the Commercial team and lead constellr’s growth with civil government customers – environmental ministries, national and regional agencies, and European institutions – who need reliable, decision-grade thermal intelligence to manage water, agriculture, infrastructure and climate resilience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is not a data-reselling role. You will sell data intelligence and analytics: understanding what public bodies are trying to achieve, shaping how our land surface temperature products and insights fit their mandates, and guiding them through funding cycles and formal procurement. You will work closely with our Product, Earth observation science and Solutions teams to translate remote sensing capability into solutions that answer real governmental needs, and alongside colleagues covering commercial, industrial and defence markets to build a coherent go-to-market across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will own a strategic portfolio from first conversation to signed contract, including major upcoming national and EU tenders, and build on constellr’s existing success in European programmes such as Copernicus. With the launch of the world’s first commercial thermal infrared constellation, the relationships you build and the deals you win will define how governments use thermal data for years to come.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(61, 116, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
