&lt;p&gt;STARK is a new kind of defence technology company revolutionizing the way autonomous systems are deployed across multiple domains. We design, develop and manufacture high performance unmanned systems that are software-defined, mass-scalable, and cost effective. This provides our operators with a decisive edge in highly contested environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re focused on delivering deployable, high-performance systems—not future promises. In a time of rising threats, STARK is bolstering the technological edge of NATO Allies and their Partners to deter aggression and defend Europe—today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Drive seamless end-to-end order processing—from entering order data into the ERP system to final product delivery—while ensuring high customer satisfaction and maintaining precise logistics standards. As &lt;strong&gt;a Senior team member&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in building and structuring end-to-end operational processes from scratch, establishing clear workflows and best practices to drive scalability and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Design &amp;amp; Implementation: Build and standardize customer operations and order-management workflows from the ground up, identifying efficiency gaps and establishing scalable SOPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Leadership: Drive the continuous improvement of internal systems and tools, setting up robust frameworks for cross-functional alignment between Sales, Logistics, and ERP architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Order Creation &amp;amp; Validation: Independently enter, review, and process incoming customer orders in the ERP system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Order Fulfillment Monitoring: Oversee the entire order lifecycle within the ERP system in close coordination with warehouse and logistics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Service &amp;amp; Communication: Proactively support domestic and international clients regarding delivery schedules, order modifications, and commercial inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claims &amp;amp; Credit Note Management: Handle customer complaints, coordinate issue resolution with cross-functional teams, and issue credit notes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trade Terms &amp;amp; Logistics Compliance: Apply appropriate Incoterms and ensure adherence to contractual delivery conditions throughout execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-Level Experience: Proven track record of building and optimizing customer operations or supply chain processes from scratch in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Completed commercial training or apprenticeship (e.g., in industrial trade, wholesale, or foreign trade) or an equivalent qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 4+ years of relevant experience in internal sales, order management, or customer service.&lt;/li&gt;
