&lt;li&gt;Key Competencies: Strong communication skills, a service-oriented mindset, reliability, and the ability to work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages: Business fluency &lt;strong&gt;in German and English &lt;/strong&gt;(both written and spoken) to support national and international clients.&lt;/li&gt;
